\subsubsection{CA\_Conv}
The detailed CA\_Conv modules are shown in \autoref{SCA_CA}.
In the Conv module, we use a $3\times3$ convolutional kernel to keep the original size of the padding and set the step size to 2 instead of using pooling layers to downsample feature maps. This approach reduces the feature map dimension while preserving the key details.

%对于给定输入的特征图的长宽属于z+，输出的特征图维度可以表示为：


For a given input feature map of dimensions $\{H_{\text{in}},W_{\text{in}}\}$, the size of output $\{H_{\text{out}},W_{\text{out}}\}$ is

\begin{align}
H_{\text{out}} &= \frac{H_{\text{in}}-f_{\text{h}}+2*P}{S}+1 \\
W_{\text{out}} &= \frac{W_{\text{in}}-f_{\text{w}}+2*P}{S}+1,
\label{convw}
\end{align}
where $f_{\text{h}}$ and $f_{\text{w}}$ are the height and width of the convolution kernel, $P$ is the padding size, and $S$ is the stride.
%公式12是特征图经过卷积层输出的长宽维度与卷积核大小、输入特征图维度、填充和步长的关系。
% Equation \eqref{convh} and \eqref{convw} describe the relationship between the dimensions of the output feature map $\mathcal{H}_{\text{output}}$ after passing through a convolutional layer and the kernel size $f$, input feature map dimensions $\mathcal{H}_{\text{input}}$, padding $P$ and stride $S$. 


%公式12是特征图经过卷积层输出的长宽维度与卷积核大小、输入特征图维度、填充和步长的关系
%As YOLOv5[1] has excellent performance in object detection, we chose CSPDarknet [26] as the backbone network of our model.CSPDarknet utilizes Cross-Stage-Partial connections to reduce the number of parameters and computation in the network, thus improving the computational efficiency. It also uses depthwise separable convolution to further reduce computation and enhance model efficiency. In CSPDarknet, the cross-stage partial network (CSP)  module is used instead of the residual module in traditional ResNet, which can enhance the feature representation while maintaining computational efficiency. The CSP module divides the input feature map into two parts, one of which is subjected to convolutional operations while the other is directly connected to the output, thus enhancing the model's ability to extract features.
%同时，CONV是backbone是的重要组成部分。为了能提高网络性能我们在CONV后面添加了通道注意力模块称为CA_conC,通道注意力是一种用于增强神经网络性能的注意力机制,它可以识别在特定任务中最有用的特征通道，对其进行加强。并通过降低不相关或冗余的特征通道的权重，有助于减少网络的计算复杂性，减小模型的参数数量，提高了模型的计算效率。CONV和CA_CONV模块分别在图3(a)和(b)给出。对于给定输入特征图X，通道注意力的计算可以分为以下步骤.
%首先对输入特征图X进行全局平均池化操作，将每个通道的特征值求平均，得到一个全局的特征向量。全局平均池化操作的结果可以表示为：A = GlobalAveragePooling(X)这里，A是全局平均池化的结果。
%接下来，对全局平均池化的结果A进行线性变换，以获得通道注意力权重。线性变换包括一个全连接层和Sigmoid激活函数.S = σ(W * A + b)
%最后，将通道注意力权重S应用到输入特征图X上，以加权每个通道的特征.加权后的输出可以表示为：
\par

We integrate a channel attention module after convolution to improve its feature extraction ability. Channel attention can identify the most related feature channels and amplify their impact. As shown in \autoref{SCA_CA} (a), the input feature map $X$ first undergoes a global average pooling, wherein the feature values from each channel are averaged, yielding a global feature vector $\vec{a}$
\begin{equation}
\vec{a} = \text{GlobalAveragePooling}(X)
\label{GAP}
\end{equation}
Subsequently, we utilize a linear transformation to obtain the channel attention weights, which are composed of a fully connected layer and a sigmoid activation function.
\begin{equation}
S_{\text{c}} = \sigma(W \cdot \vec{a} + b)
\label{sigmoid}
\end{equation}
where $S_{\text{c}}$ is channel attention weights, $W$ is the weight matrixis, $b$ is the bias, and $\sigma$ is the Sigmoid function. $S_{\text{c}}$ obtained from Equation~\eqref{sigmoid} assigns large values to important channels, enabling the model to capture key features.

In the end, $S_{\text{c}}$ is multiplied by the result of the convolution operation on the input feature $X$, weighting the contributions of each channel.
\begin{equation}
Y =Conv(X) \odot S_{\text{c}}
\label{apply}
\end{equation}
where $Y$ is the weighted output and $\odot$ is element-wise multiplication.\par




%为了提高模型的表征能力，我们将空间和通道注意机制串联成混合注意力引入传统的带有3个卷积的CSP瓶颈（C3）模块中，C3 模块通常由3个卷积层组成，其中包括一个 CSP 瓶颈部分。这个 CSP 瓶颈部分使用了跨阶段部分连接的方法，以提高信息传递的效率和特征重用的能力。通过这种方式，C3 模块可以在保持模型轻量化的同时，增强特征的表征能力和语义信息的传递。通道注意力能够捕捉不同特征通道之间的相关性，而空间注意力能够确定输入特征图中不同区域的重要性，通过结合这两种注意力机制，模型可以更全面地理解输入数据，并更准确地提取有用的特征。SCA\_C3模块结构如图\ref{SCA_C3}（b）所示。

