    \item We propose a novel approach for modeling opinion propagation by integrating multi-dimensional Hawkes processes with GNN. This method effectively captures temporal dynamics, hierarchical structures, and multi-dimensional interactions in social media discussions.
    \item We release the VISTA dataset, a multi-scale public opinion resource that tracks the complete life cycles of 159 viral topics. The dataset includes over 500,000 hierarchically structured comments, annotated with fine-grained sentiment labels across 11 categories.
