\section{Motivation and Background}
\label{sec:background}
In this section, we motivate \carbonContainerS by analyzing real-world data on grid energy's carbon-intensity (\Section\ref{sec:grid}), cloud datacenters' workload-intensity (\Section\ref{sec:cloud}), and their impact on both energy- and carbon-efficiency (\Section\ref{sec:carbon}). 

