\subsection{Paper Organisation}
This work is organised as follows. We begin with preliminary definitions in Section~\ref{sec:prelims}. Definitions of existing interval width parameters are given in Section~\ref{sec:existing}, and followed by the definition of our new parameter in Section~\ref{sec:TIM-Def}. We give our meta-algorithms in Section~\ref{sec:meta}, and an example of their use in Section~\ref{sec:applications}. We finish with some concluding remarks in Section~\ref{sec:conclusion}. 
