\subsection*{Accuracy and F1 Scores}

To complement the insights provided by the ROC curves, we evaluated the performance of the model at specific decision thresholds. We select the optimal classification threshold for each model by maximizing Youden's J statistic \cite{YoudensJ} and assess their performance using standard metrics such as accuracy and the F1 score. Table~\ref{tab:model-performance} presents a comparison of classification performance between the four models tested using their respective optimal thresholds.

