$w(ABC) = \dfrac{1}{2\pi} \left( \angle AOB + \angle BOC + \angle COA \right) = +1\quad\text{и}$
$$2\pi\cdot w(ABCD) = 
%\dfrac{1}{2\pi} \left( 
\angle AOB + \angle BOC + \angle COD + \angle DOA =  
