The regular expression check (R) at the start of the algorithm can be performed deterministically in linear time. Each iteration of the main loop (M) goes through the integers from $i$ down to 1 to check whether the input satisfies the following conditions imposed by the definition in Equations \ref{eqn:rpaldef} and \ref{eqn:rldef}:  
