We assume that the set $\mathcal N$ is monotone in that if $\bm n \in \mathcal N$ then $\bm n' \in \mathcal N$ for all $\bm n'\in \mathbb Z_+^R$ satisfying $\bm n'\leq \bm n$. We note that this assumption will ensure that our policy and the MaxWeight policy is work conserving.

