    $\omega \in \Cscr_p$ for a prime $p$. Then, using the previous claim we obtain that
    \[
    \phi_{E_i, p}(x)  \equiv \phi_{1, p}(x^{(2,2,1,2)})
    \]
    is an internal reference to $E_i^\Ical$ and is satisfied by $\overline{\omega}$ on $\overline{\Cscr}$.
